     },
     "hold": 14
    }
   },
   {
    "q": "THEN WHAT",
    "a": "AFTER 31, START AT THE BOTTOM LEFT.\nAT 32 THE BOTTOM LINE TURNS SOLID.\nUP THE LEFT HALF TO QIAN, 63.",
